  "anchors_note": "Per variant, in the mesh's own UE frame at its native size (cm; x right, y front, z up, origin the floor centre): the point ON the surface where the middle of each thing goes. lid_label: flat, its top edge towards -y. front_label (crates): standing on the front, facing +y. note: SM_sticky_note's origin (its back face). Scale each anchor by the box's scale; don't scale the label or note. Place them exactly there (at most 0.05 cm proud): a crate's battens stand 2.2 cm out from its boards, so its bounds are not its surface."
